4. 13% accounts for (*2  x aggresive people who control US military i.e. Trump & Pete Hegseth)* & risk of miscalculation if Oman finalizes its Iran deal which Trump interprets as direct challenge and/or if any Hormuz incident involving Omani waters escalates beyond control
5. **The 40 Trillion dollar debt is also a factor in following way**; Attack/threat Oman to force it to pressure Iran into reopening the SoH, which would crash oil prices, may allow the Federal Reserve to slash interest rates which in turn **slashes the US government's annual interest payments on its \$40 trillion debt by hundreds of billions of dollars**&#x20;
